  "annotations": {
    "summary": "tokens-assets: logo-sync returned 5xx on ≥2 runs in the last hour",
    "description": "POST /jobs/logo-sync on the assets worker answers 5xx only when every attempted mint failed (ok:false) or the handler threw — per-mint fetch failures never fail the batch. Two or more in an hour (Scheduler retries once) means the job cannot publish anything: check GCS_LOGO_BUCKET / bucket IAM, the mint_logos table (migration 0023/0024), and the worker logs for the {\"event\":\"logo_sync\"} summary. Per-URL fetch noise (404s, redirects, blocked IPFS gateways) is expected and deliberately excluded from the provider error-rate rules.",
    "runbook_url": "https://github.com/solana-foundation/tokens/blob/main/docs/operations/logo-sync.md"
